flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare update for first name, last name, email]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind new values and user ID]
    D --> E[Execute update]
    E --> F{Rows updated > 0?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Return true]
    F -- No --> H[Return false]
    C --> I[On SQL error print stack trace]
    I --> H
    G --> J[End]
    H --> J
